-> Tutorial step 3: `link` pulls in validate-basic.code, aliased to
-> `validate`. Dispatching to it (`to validate`) works exactly like
-> dispatching to a handler defined in this file (`to this`, step 2).
link validate-basic as validate

emit Order { item = "Coffee", quantity = 3, unit_price = 4.5 } to validate get good
assert good.total = 13.5
